function dcV3ShowTooltip(node){const text=dcV3TooltipText(node);if(!text){dcV3HideTooltip();return}const layer=dcV3EnsureTooltipLayer();dcV3HideTooltip();dcV3TooltipActive=node;node.setAttribute("aria-describedby",layer.id);layer.textContent=text;layer.classList.add("is-visible");dcV3PositionTooltip(node)}
